{"resourceIdentifier":"4454","resourceName":"The project of Kitchen and catering waste Disposal Phase II in Wuchang area","description":"The project of Kitchen and catering waste Disposal Phase II in Wuchang area (hereinafter\r\nreferred to as the Project), constructed by Wuhan Carbon Ring Ecology Co., Ltd. Biogas is\r\nproduced by anaerobic digestion of organic kitchen waste from MSW(municipal solid waste).\r\ngenerating sets and boilers are used to generate electricity and steam, and a large amount\r\nof waste heat is generated during operation, which can be used to heat the plant's\r\nproduction process and also for heating the living area. The electricity generated will be\r\nused for the electricity needs of the site, reducing the running costs of the project, and the\r\nexcess biogas will be flared to the air. The surplus biogas will be used for power generation\r\nafter approval by the relevant authorities, and the surplus electricity will be integrated into\r\nthe power grid to generate certain economic benefits while giving priority to meeting its own\r\nelectricity consumption. The project avoids the greenhouse gases generated by landfill and\r\nreplaces the equivalent power supply from the fossil fuel power plant-based power grid in\r\ncentral China and the equivalent heat supply from local coal-fired boilers, thus achieving the\r\nobjective of reducing greenhouse gas emissions.","location":{"latitude":30.375299,"longitude":114.253469},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2023-08-22","endExclusive":"2023-09-22","endInclusive":"2023-09-21"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"4454"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Hubei"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Wuhan Carbon Ring Ecology Co., Ltd."},{"type":"string","value":"Hubei Province, China"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STAT